":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"V1n-wIrt5xtI0VIAxIP5dA","review_id":"3fo8ajfrcove8OM2TESMjg","date":"2021-08-26T22:27:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9517529010772705,"text_excerpt":"We enjoyed the foods here! Their spicy is actually pretty spicy - I got medium and it had a good kick. I love eating spicy foods so was pleasantly surprised that a medium would actually burn my mouth a bit. I ordered a pound of head on shrimp in the boil house sauce which is essentially all the seasonings/sauces, medium spicy. We also shared half a dozen of the char grilled oysters. Others had the mussels + shrimp no spice, shrimp po boy sandwich, salad, fettuccine noodles, fire brussels sprouts. Our waitress was friendly and attentive. The restaurant was empty when we arrived on a Sunday lunch but slowly started to fill up closer to 1pm. Still plenty of tables available. We got our foods..."},{"business_id":"V1n-wIrt5xtI0VIAxIP5dA","review_id":"csuJd0C27npU_eNkp2aVLQ","date":"2021-08-11T04:20:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9405773282051086,"text_excerpt":"Came here for my birthday tonight and had a delicious messy cajun seafood feast. We ordered \"The House\" - the giant bucket with snow crab, shrimp, sausage and crawfish. We chose mild cajun seasoning and glad we did. Even the mild was super spicy. Service was fine but we had to hail down our server for basics such as crab crackers and something for our shells. We had a great time, though. We would certainly return."},{"business_id":"V1n-wIrt5xtI0VIAxIP5dA","review_id":"irzArrFB4rRnl_SOyNQ_bQ","date":"2018-04-14T01:06:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9403437972068787,"text_excerpt":"This seafood house is BRAND NEW and I'm super excited to review while it's still so new. Some friends and I came because we heard there would be an option to have your crawfish cooked with an Asian-flavored sauce. Gotta be honest, not everything we had was WOW, but I'm bumping up my 3.5 stars to 4 because this restaurant offers flavors that are much desired to the New Orleans food scene. You know I'm here for the food diversity. To share, we got an order of fries and the Crab Lagoon Dip, both of which were fine. Nothing spectacular, but definitely tasty. The dip had a nice creamy texture with a generous portion of crab. The fries are kind of like thinly sliced steak fries. They serve the ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"V1n-wIrt5xtI0VIAxIP5dA","photo_id":"WKuJzS67IgP2Jgp8DOET8w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WKuJzS67IgP2Jgp8DOET8w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8805341720581055},{"business_id":"V1n-wIrt5xtI0VIAxIP5dA","photo_id":"kwCc0W6bJvtnYjBpfusJsg","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/kwCc0W6bJvtnYjBpfusJsg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8798509836196899},{"business_id":"V1n-wIrt5xtI0VIAxIP5dA","photo_id":"muTBw8F2Xfw5AuL9YnhxYQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/muTBw8F2Xfw5AuL9YnhxYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8283758163452148},{"business_id":"V1n-wIrt5xtI0VIAxIP5dA","photo_id":"Dm7rweY-RN05ghHgEwa8Gg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Dm